# Unity performance and async

RulePackVersion: 1.3.0

- Flag Vector3.Distance or magnitude used only for threshold comparison in per-frame or network hot paths; suggest sqrMagnitude.
- Flag unnecessary UnityEngine to Unity.Mathematics conversion in inner loops.
- Flag mixed coroutine/Task/UniTask in one flow without clear reason.
- Prefer UniTask for new Unity gameplay async when the project references Cysharp.Threading.Tasks.